---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Lists" description="音乐、电影与友链。">
  <main class="page-shell" id="content">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="kicker">Music / Film / Links</p>
      <h1>Lists</h1>
      <p>先把入口放在同一页。清单本身还在填。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="stack">
      <section class="list-block">
        <h2>音乐</h2>
        <p class="note-desc">这里会放我常听的音乐清单。</p>
      </section>
      <section class="list-block">
        <h2>电影</h2>
        <p class="note-desc">这里会放我看过或推荐的电影。</p>
      </section>
      <section class="list-block">
        <h2>友链</h2>
        <p class="note-desc">友链与推荐站点。有想交换的，走 GitHub 提 issue。</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
